% UTIL: HELPERS FOR THE TESTS.  "[" MARKS THE P STACK ON THE L STACK; ".S"
% PRINTS WHAT IS ABOVE THE MARK, DEEPEST FIRST, AND DROPS IT.  DON'T USE
% THEM ACROSS A DO LOOP, WHICH ALSO USES THE L STACK.
ASSEMBLER<
'SP@ : MOVL P -(P) ;
>
0 'SA VARIABLE
'[ : MARK ;
'.S : RECALL SA ! SP@ SA @ BEGIN 4- DDUP GE IF DUP @ = REPEAT 2DROP SA @ NOTE RESTORE ;
